title: '[pallet-revive] eth-rpc: map EthRpcError to EIP-1474 error codes'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    closes https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/issues/11886

    Map each `EthRpcError` variant to the JSON-RPC error code defined in EIP-1474 (-32602 invalid params, -32001 resource not found, -32003 transaction rejected) instead of collapsing every non-`ClientError` to a blanket `-32600 Invalid Request`.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-eth-rpc
  bump: patch
